        <name>9.5. La Trini</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://doc-00-0s-mymaps.googleusercontent.com/untrusted/hostedimage/1tom5k8hq5k7koq6sa1hkjkovk/ajtgv5j8musjf75ssonknc3prg/1695378064250/xUcpN3FudnuQYrEAf25SWSdkT0JYD12L/17346896698994278261/5AJ9UNGrVTb_gHmEgz-Wvmn-djuAvpKahDS-J3VbdkCHDP5ICkrpRvxFnnVALa0A3Lv2aAFEgT2vgg15wcb-JOg5XNzpu4LlNkREDHXuHsqVct4vlrlEryIb4S6Ly7iP7vrnR3emyiNpgviVXxmm81oFrhSS2p5MKNzUfguMvzXrj909x0vUMafvZ_cg92VP-?session=0&fife" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>DL-DG: 9:00–2:00<br><br>Hem tornat el 11/06/2019: mateixa critica pq estan putament bones :P<br><br>Preu: 5,5. Quantitat: 10. Patates: 9. Salsa: 10. Nota final: 9,5<br>Yuka: bones pero les pitjors. Potser per la yuka en si. Salsa molt bona, es la textura de la patata qe no conven.<br>Moniato: niceeee. Fritura de 10 i pesto bunissin. Original i sorprenent<br>Patata: frankies style. Salsa i patates molt be<br>Les recomanaries?: si<br>Imprescindibles?: si<br><br><img src="https://doc-14-0s-mymaps.googleusercontent.com/untrusted/hostedimage/1tom5k8hq5k7koq6sa1hkjkovk/shm2j4cr1dg5ejk6cmcbjep4c8/1695378064250/xUcpN3FudnuQYrEAf25SWSdkT0JYD12L/17346896698994278261/5AJ9UNGokDnJ0gxPbasdwMW66LWcZSeczbDBXZ8yNKrHNl4AU1OBaENyEqZimgGSJB2coZWAb3WWmeAOWHo3QGbzocE3CMgW1T1mfrHw5D_qf1Nvt6SqbHT2SVwYLp4P-gdNQ3RCleQjqNRDCTdgf-6eenBxUNGx4JhAgB26KNG3i-hZ5alntB1NuPozfw_Ax?session=0&fife" height="200" width="auto" />]]></description>
