        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://doc-0c-0s-mymaps.googleusercontent.com/untrusted/hostedimage/1tom5k8hq5k7koq6sa1hkjkovk/37ifb01jhv920n8av0f3niecak/1695378064250/xUcpN3FudnuQYrEAf25SWSdkT0JYD12L/17346896698994278261/5AJ9UNGqBfQszuYkcGDStPsLyiybu7usXe5rvuFRETzUar-6xx0bF2lsxEvt2QHK3RF5RkRAggl8Rp4hQUfPsI2EY-mxQcoWu9B73nFqfZrAN77ZIWDZRw4HJyM_umWcRWKnmN3dGeJtbvE4iJL3QdW2UlhNuWYDOAv3Z-gnS-p6jfS9nXlqSCu4iaA1giOV7?session=0&fife" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Preu: 4. Quantitat: 8. Patates: 9,5. Salsa: 9,5. Nota final: 9,5. Les patates estan bones i ben fetes. Les salses....no sabem que son, pero estan molt bones. La blanca es com un allioliromesco molt suau i la vermella pimenton a saco.<br>Les recomanaries?: si<br>Imprescindibles?: si]]></description>
