        <name>9.5. Bodega La Palma</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://doc-0k-0s-mymaps.googleusercontent.com/untrusted/hostedimage/1tom5k8hq5k7koq6sa1hkjkovk/j2pcrv4lhko9d7vnpul622mafo/1695378064250/xUcpN3FudnuQYrEAf25SWSdkT0JYD12L/17346896698994278261/5AJ9UNGqNRFMZYQA1EX2QDyagtA8MYcKiGEYdi1du2qwYJWIvPANXGcgXYpjfLHpFoIKTc_PfYaQJnEMFgMQsQIY8-TbGgg-zjdfnv_Bg6vuCiIG06tguRremyBqJJRCJ29Bed8wESN24Wm4OTV6mEGit2qOl_BnBq_4fFFXBtWXe674OpyPKADFV5uzAeKMi?session=0&fife" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>Preu: 5.25€. Quantitat: 7. Patates: 10. Salsa: 9. Nota final: 9,5. Vull dir: aixi es fan les patates d’unes braves. Salsa allioli cremos, i una salsa vermella bastant potent i un xiiiic picant (igual a la yolanda li piquen molt 🤷🏻‍♀️)<br>Les recomanaries?: si<br>Imprescindibles?: si<br>DATA: 6/8/2019<br><br>DL-DV 9:00–0:00<br>DS 12:00–0:00<br><br>bravasBCN]]></description>
